# Customer Who Visited but Did Not Make Any Transactions

## Problem Summary
Write a query to find the customer_id of customers who visited the store without making any transactions, along with the number of such visits (count_no_trans).
Sort the results as required by the problem statement.

## Solution

```sql
select v.customer_id, count(v.visit_id) as count_no_trans 
from visits v left join transactions t
on v.visit_id = t.visit_id 
where t.transaction_id is NULL 
group by v.customer_id;
```
